# Frameworks Goldmine

64 frameworks from Feb-July 2025. Source files are Google Docs (`.gdoc` shortcuts in the junction). Open from Google Drive to read content.

## Index

```dataview
TABLE file.ext AS "Type", file.cday AS "Created"
FROM "_frameworks"
WHERE file.name != "_README"
SORT file.name ASC
```

